Port FileZilla Client to wxWidgets 3.3 (upstream targets 3.2.x).

Upstream's configure explicitly rejects wxWidgets 3.3 ("You must use
wxWidgets 3.2.x"); relax that gate. The remaining hunks are compile/runtime
fixes for wx 3.3 API changes:

- aui_notebook_ex.cpp: GetTabSize override signature wxDC& -> wxReadOnlyDC&;
  drop the base wxAuiNotebook::OnTabDragMotion(evt) call (3.3.2 made tab-drag
  handling internal and removed that overload).
- fileexistsdlg.cpp: wxIcon SetHandle/SetSize -> InitFromHICON.
- LocalTreeView.cpp, sitemanager_controls.cpp, optionspage_filetype.cpp:
  explicit wide-char/string literals (wx 3.3 dropped wxString implicit
  narrow conversions).
- file_utils.cpp: create the modal-loop helper window hidden and size-less;
  wxTRANSPARENT_WINDOW is a no-op since wx 3.3, so the helper became an
  opaque child that blanked the file list/tree behind shell dialogs.
- Mainfrm.cpp: create/reparent the message-log view as a child of the queue
  notebook before AddPage; wx 3.3.3 no longer reparents pages in
  wxAuiNotebook::InsertPage and asserts instead.

Derived from Pharaoh2k/FileZilla-Themed-For-Windows (GPLv3+).

